# ==========================================
# Local save files, high scores, and player unlock stats
save.json
**/save.json
*save*.json
*.save
*.save.*
saves/
**/saves/
stats.json
*stats*.json
stats.dat
high_score*.json
profile*.json
settings.json
local_settings.py

